  "baseRefName": "main",
  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Update installed Sepo agent infrastructure from `.agent/package.json` version `0.1.0` to `0.3.1`.\n- Sync source-owned `.agent/` and bundled `.github` agent assets from `self-evolving/repo@v0.3.1` (`c058dba69a2773cd5837b1d2a5883a1042ee26b5`).\n- Add new v0.3.1 agent workflows/prompts for install, update-agent, follow-up routing, self-approval, and self-merge support.\n- Add a local CommonJS package marker for `.github/actions/resolve-agent-provider` so the bundled resolver runs correctly in this repository, whose root package is ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`).\n\n## Audit / scope\n\n| Area | Outcome |\n| --- | --- |\n| `.agent/` | Replaced with v0.3.1 source content, excluding generated/dependency directories (`dist/`, `node_modules/`). |\n| `.github/actions`, `.github/prompts`, `.github/workflows` agent assets | Updated/additively synced from v0.3.1. Removed obsolete source-owned provider resolver shell script in favor of the new JS resolver. |\n| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE` | Added Sepo-owned `agent-goal.yml` and `install-sepo.yml`. |\n| Target-owned `.github` files | Preserved: `deploy.yml`, `preview.yml`, `dependabot.yml`, `bug_report.md`, `feature_request.md`, and `pull_request_template.md`. |\n| `.gitignore` | Already contained `.agent/node_modules/` and `.agent/dist/`; unchanged. |\n| App/source files | Not touched. |\n| `.skills/` / `AGENT.md` | Not present and not added. |\n\n## Branch/ref status\n\n- `agent/memory` exists and was not changed.\n- `agent/rubrics` is not present; no rubrics branch was initialized by this PR.\n- Existing `refs/agent-state/*` refs were observed and not changed.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check` ✅\n- `npm --prefix .agent ci` ✅\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build` ✅\n- `npm --prefix .agent test` ✅ (`713` tests passing)\n- Parsed all `.github/workflows/*.yml` with the bundled YAML parser ✅\n\n## Post-merge notes\n\n- Run `Agent / Onboarding / Check Setup` to refresh the setup check issue against the updated workflows.\n- Do **not** rerun memory initialization unless `agent/memory` is intentionally removed; it already exists.\n- If this repo wants rubric steering, run `Agent / Rubrics / Initialization` after merge.\n- Smoke test with an issue comment such as `@sepo-agent /answer ...` after required secrets/auth are confirmed.\n",
  "closedAt": null,
